Delete Your Love Birds Account

If you would like to delete your Love Birds account and associated data, you can request account deletion by contacting us.

How to request deletion:

Email us at:
support@lovebirdsapps.com

Use the subject:
Delete My Love Birds Account

Please include the email address used for your Love Birds account.

What data will be deleted:

Your user profile
Your name
Your email address
Your profile photo
Your relationship details
Your memories
Your notes
Your mood data
Your bucket list items
Your places data
Your app-related account data

Shared couple data:

If you are connected with a partner, shared couple content may also be deleted or disconnected depending on the account status and ownership of the shared couple space.

Data we may keep:

We may keep limited information if required for legal, security, fraud prevention, or operational reasons.

Deletion timeframe:

We aim to process account deletion requests within 30 days.

Contact:

support@lovebirdsapps.com
